te direction card (1-4-1-2-1) holds the other authored value\">Sweden → Tunisia</p>\n<p class=\"mt-0.5 text-[11px] font-semibold text-[#3F5F97]\" data-dynamic=\"true\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-1-2-2\" data-name=\"direction departures and spaces subtitle\" data-reason=\"departure and space counts are recomputed from the swapped direction state\">3 departures · 9 spaces left</p>\n</div>\n<i class=\"ph ph-caret-up text-[13px] text-[#3F5F97]\" data-dynamic=\"true\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-1-3\" data-name=\"collapse caret icon\" data-reason=\"caret direction toggles between up and down by the expand/collapse script\"></i>\n</button>\n<div class=\"px-3 pb-3 pt-3\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-2\" data-name=\"departure list container\">\n<!-- next departure: the loaded bay -->\n<div class=\"rounded-[18px] bg-[#0B1B33] p-3.5\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-2-1\" data-name=\"featured next departure card\">\n<div class=\"flex items-start justify-between\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-2-1-1\" data-name=\"departure date and time row\">\n<div data-kid=\"1-3-1-2-1-1-1\" data-name=\"departure date container\">\n<p class=\"text-[10.5px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.7px] text-[#9CB0D1]\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-2-1-1-1-1\" data-name=\"departure day label\">Mon 2 Nov</p>\n<p class=\"mt-1 text-[24px] font-extrabold leading-none tracking-[-0.4px] text-white\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-2-1-1-1-2\" data-name=\"departure time headline\">08:00</p>\n</div>\n<span class=\"px-2 py-[4px] text-[9px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.7px] text-[#0B1B33]\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-2-1-1-2\" data-name=\"vehicle type badge\" style=\"background:#FFFFFF;clip-path:polygon(0 0,100% 0,100% 100%,7px 100%,0 calc(100% - 7px))\">Truck</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"mt-2.5 flex items-end justify-between gap-2\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-2-1-2\" data-name=\"departure route and capacity row\">\n<p class=\"text-[13.5px] font-bold leading-tight text-white\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-2-1-2-1\" data-name=\"departure route text\">Stockholm → Tunis</p>\n<p class=\"shrink-0 text-[9.5px] font-bold uppercase tra