] leading-[19px] text-[#55627A]\"><i class=\"ti ti-info-circle mr-1.5 text-[#132B55]\"></i>Timetable is subject to changes. Stay updated via the app.</p></div><button class=\"mt-5 h-12 w-full rounded-full bg-[#132B55] text-[15px] font-semibold text-white\">View departure</button></article><div class=\"pb-8\"></div></div>",
