8 8 0 0 1 16 0\"/></svg></span></div></div></div>\n<section style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:20px\" data-kid=\"1-3\" data-name=\"Widget size specifications\">\n<div class=\"card\" style=\"padding:20px\" data-kid=\"1-3-1\" data-name=\"Medium widget specification\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between\" data-kid=\"auto-56\"><div data-kid=\"auto-57\"><p class=\"eyebrow\" style=\"margin:0\" data-kid=\"auto-58\">MEDIUM · 2 × 2</p><h2 style=\"font-size:18px;margin:8px 0 0\" data-kid=\"auto-59\">Departure card</h2></div><span style=\"color:#147A48;background:#E7F5EE;border:1px solid #BFE5D1;border-radius:99px;padding:6px 10px;font-size:10px;font-weight:700\" data-kid=\"auto-60\">PRIMARY</span></div><div style=\"margin-top:16px;background:#F8FAFC;border:1px solid #E4E9F0;border-radius:17px;padding:16px;max-width:480px\" data-kid=\"auto-61\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:7px\" data-kid=\"auto-62\"><span style=\"width:7px;height:7px;border-radius:50%;background:#F2761B\" data-kid=\"auto-63\"></span><span style=\"font-size:9px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.12em;color:#8A97AC\" data-kid=\"auto-64\">NEXT DEPARTURE</span><span style=\"margin-left:auto;color:#132B55;font-size:10px;font-weight:700\" data-kid=\"auto-65\">IN 5 DAYS</span></div><div style=\"font-size:17px;font-weight:700;margin-top:12px\" data-kid=\"auto-66\">Sweden <span style=\"color:#F2761B\" data-kid=\"auto-67\">→</span> Tunisia</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;font-size:11px;color:#55627A;margin-top:5px\" data-kid=\"auto-68\"><span data-kid=\"auto-69\">Stockholm → Tunis</span><span style=\"margin-left:auto\" data-kid=\"auto-70\">15 Nov · 14:00</span></div><div style=\"height:1px;background:#E4E9F0;margin:12px 0 9px\" data-kid=\"auto-71\"></div><div style=\"font-size:10px;color:#132B55;font-weight:600\" data-kid=\"auto-72\">Cargo van <span style=\"float:right;color:#55627A;font-weight:500\" data-kid=\"auto-73\">24 spaces available</span></div></div></div>\n<div style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:20px\" data-kid=\"auto-74\"><div class=\"card\" style=\"padding:18px\" data-kid=\"1-3-2\" data-name=\"Small widget specification\"><p class=\"eyebrow\" style=\"margin:0\" data-kid=\"auto-75\">SMALL · 2 × 2</p><h2 style=\"font-size:17px;margin:8px 0 0\" data-kid=\"auto-76\">Next departure</h2><div style=\"margin-top:14px;background:#F8FAFC;border:1px solid #E4E9F0;border-radius:16px;padding:13px\" data-kid=\"auto-77\"><div style=\"font-size:9px;color:#8A97AC;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.1em\" data-kid=\"auto-78\">15 NOV · 14:00</div><div style=\"font-size:13px;font-weight:700;margin-top:7px\" data-kid=\"auto-79\">Sweden → Tunisia</div><div style=\"font-size:10px;color:#55627A;margin-top:5px\" data-kid=\"auto-80\">Stockholm → Tunis</div></div></div><div class=\"card\" style=\"padding:18px\" data-kid=\"1-3-3\" data-name=\"Countdown widget specification\"><p class=\"eyebrow\" style=\"margin:0\" data-kid=\"auto-81\">SMALL · 2 × 2</p><h2 style=\"font-size:17px;margin:8px 0 0\" data-kid=\"auto-82\">Countdown</h2><div style=\"margin-top:14px;background:#132B55;border-radius:16px;padding:13px;color:#fff\" data-kid=\"auto-83\"><div style=\"font-size:9px;color:#C7D3E6;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.1em\" data-kid=\"auto-84\">DEPARTS IN</div><div style=\"font-size:27px;font-weight:700;margin-top:6px\" data-kid=\"auto-85\">05 <span style=\"font-size:11px;font-weight:500\" data-kid=\"auto-86\">days</span></div><div style=\"font-size:10px;color:#D9E2F1;margin-top:2px\" data-kid=\"auto-87\">Stockholm → Tunis</div></div></div></div>\n<div style=\"padding:16px 18px;border-radius:17px;background:#FFF4EC;border:1px solid #FFE7D4;display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:flex-start\" data-kid=\"auto-88\"><div style=\"width:20px;height:20px;border-radius:50%;background:#F2761B;color:#fff;display:grid;place-items:center;font-size:12px;font-weight:700\" data-kid=\"auto-89\">i</div><div data-kid=\"auto-9