      },
      "html": "<style>\n@import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Rubik:wght@400;500;600;700;800&display=swap');\n*{box-sizing:border-box}body{margin:0}\n.rk{font-family:Rubik,system-ui,sans-serif;color:#0C1626;-webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased}\n:root{--navy:#132B55;--orange:#F2761B;--ink:#0C1626;--muted:#55627A;--line:#E4E9F0;--canvas:#F4F6FA}\n.i{display:inline-block;vertical-align:middle}\n.eyebrow{font-size:10px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.12em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#8A97AC}\n.card{background:#fff;border:1px solid #E4E9F0;border-radius:18px;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(6,16,31,.05)}\n.spec{display:flex;gap:8px;font-size:11.5px;color:#55627A;line-height:1.45;margin-top:8px}\n.dot{width:5px;height:5px;border-radius:50%;background:#F2761B;flex:0 0 auto;margin-top:6px}\n.chip{font-size:10px;font-weight:700;border-radius:99px;padding:6px 10px;display:inline-block}\n.island{background:#050506;color:#fff;box-shadow:0 16px 36px rgba(5,5,6,.28)}\n</style>\n<div class=\"rk\" style=\"width:1280px;min-height:925px;background:#F4F6FA;padding:42px 56px\" data-kid=\"1\" data-name=\"Dynamic Island states board\">\n\n  <header style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;margin-bottom:26px\" data-kid=\"1-1\" data-name=\"Board header\">\n    <div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14px\" data-kid=\"1-1-1\">\n      <div style=\"width:42px;height:42px;border-radius:14px;background:#132B55;display:grid;place-items:center;color:#fff\" data-kid=\"1-1-1-1\">\n        <svg class=\"i\" width=\"22\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 28 18\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\">\n          <rect x=\"1\" y=\"1\" width=\"26\" height=\"16\" rx=\"8\"/>\n          <circle cx=\"20\" cy=\"9\" r=\"2.6\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\"/>\n        </svg>\n      </div>\n      <div data-kid=\"1-1-1-2\">\n        <div style=\"font-size:18px;font-weight:700\">Dynamic Island &amp; Live Activity</div>\n        <div style=\"font-size:12px;color:#55627A;margin-top:2px\">ActivityKit · compact, minimal and expanded states for the next departure</div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div style=\"display:flex;gap:8px\" data-kid=\"1-1-2\">\n      <span style=\"display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;border-radius:99px;padding:8px 12px;background:#fff;border:1px solid #E4E9F0;font-size:11px;font-weight:600;color:#55627A\">iOS 16.2+</span>\n      <span style=\"display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;border-radius:99px;padding:8px 12px;background:#fff;border:1px solid #E4E9F0;font-size:11px;font-weight:600;color:#55627A\"><b style=\"color:#132B55\">37</b> pt compact</span>\n      <span style=\"display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;border-radius:99px;padding:8px 12px;background:#fff;border:1px solid #E4E9F0;font-size:11px;font-weight:600;color:#55627A\"><b style=\"color:#132B55\">371</b> pt expanded</span>\n      <span style=\"display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;border-radius:99px;padding:8px 12px;background:#FFF4EC;border:1px solid #FFE7D4;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;color:#D65E0A\">DESIGN REVIEW</span>\n    </div>\n  </header>\n\n  <div style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:30px;align-items:start\" data-kid=\"1-2\">\n\n    <section data-kid=\"1-2-1\" data-name=\"Island state previews\">\n\n      <div style=\"background:#0A0E15;border-radius:30px;padding:16px 16px 20px;box-shadow:0 20px 44px rgba(10,14,21,.2)\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-1\" data-name=\"iPhone top with compact and minimal states\">\n        <div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;color:#fff;font-size:11px;font-weight:600;padding:0 4px\">\n          <span>9:41</span>\n          <svg width=\"46\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 48 14\" fill=\"currentColor\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n            <path d=\"M1 12V9h3v3H1Zm5 0V6h3v6H6Zm5 0V3h3v9h-3Z\"/>\n            <path d=\"M19 5.2a7.1 7.1 0 0 1 10 0M21.5 7.8a3.6 3.6 0 0 1 5 0\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/>\n            <circle cx=\"24\" cy=\"10.5\" r=\".9\"/>\n            <rect x=\"34\" y=\"3\" width=\"11\" height=\"8\" rx=\"1.5\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"/>\n            <rect x=\"36\" y=\"5\" width=\"7\" height=\"4\"/>\n          </svg>\n        </div>\n\n        <div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:center;margin-top:14px\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-1-1\" data-name=\"Compact presentation\">\n          <div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:26px\">\n            <div class=\"island\" style=\"height:37px;min-width:112px;border-radius:19px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:8px;padding:0 14px\">\n              <span style=\"width:7px;height:7px;border-radius:50%;background:#F2761B\"></span>\n              <svg class=\"i\" width=\"17\" height=\"17\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#F2761B\" stroke-width=\"1.9\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"><path d=\"M3 16h18l-2-6H6l-3 6Z\"/><path d=\"M6 16v2m12-2v2\"/><circle cx=\"7\" cy=\"17\" r=\"1.5\"/><circle cx=\"17\" cy=\"17\" r=\"1.5\"/></svg>\n            </div>\n            <div style=\"width:9px;height:9px;border-radius:50%;background:#050506;box-shadow:inset 0 0 0 1.5px #1B2430\"></div>\n            <div class=\"island\" style=\"height:37px;min-width:58px;border-radius:19px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;padding:0 13px\">\n              <span style=\"font-size:12px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.2px\">14:00</span>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <div style=\"text-align:center;font-size:9px;color:rgba(255,255,255,.5);font-weight:600;margin-top:12px\">COMPACT · truck leading, departure time trailing</div>\n\n        <div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:center;margin-top:22px\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-1-2\" data-name=\"Minimal presentation\">\n          <div class=\"island\" style=\"height:37px;min-width:64px;border-radius:19px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:7px;padding:0 12px\">\n            <svg class=\"i\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#F2761B\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"><path d=\"M3 16h18l-2-6H6l-3 6Z\"/><circle cx=\"7\" cy=\"17\" r=\"1.6\"/><circle cx=\"17\" cy=\"17\" r=\"1.6\"/></svg>\n            <span style=\"font-size:10.5px;font-weight:700\">5d</span>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <div style=\"text-align:center;font-size:9px;color:rgba(255,255,255,.5);font-weight:600;margin-top:12px\">MINIMAL · icon + days left when another activity is present</div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"eyebrow\" style=\"margin:24px 0 10px 4px\">EXPANDED · SCHEDULED</div>\n      <div class=\"island\" style=\"border-radius:30px;padding:16px 17px\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-2\" data-name=\"Expanded island — scheduled departure\">\n        <div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:11px\">\n          <div style=\"width:36px;height:36px;border-radius:50%;background:rgba(242,118,27,.16);display:grid;place-items:center;color:#F2761B\">\n            <svg class=\"i\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.9\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"><path d=\"M3 16h18l-2-6H6l-3 6Z\"/><path d=\"M6 16v2m12-2v2\"/><circle cx=\"7\" cy=\"17\" r=\"1.5\"/><circle cx=\"17\" cy=\"17\" r=\"1.5\"/></svg>\n          </div>\n          <div style=\"flex:1;min-width:0\">\n            <div style=\"font-size:9px;color:#9AA6B8;font-weight:600\">Next departure</div>\n            <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;font-weight:700;margin-top:3px\">Stockholm <span style=\"color:#F2761B\">→</span> Tunis</div>\n          </div>\n          <div style=\"text-align:right\">\n            <div style=\"font-size:11.5px;font-weight:700\">15 Nov · 14:00</div>\n            <div style=\"font-size:9px;color:#9AA6B8;margin-top:3px\">in 5 days</div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <div style=\"height:1px;background:#1E2129;margin:12px 0 11px\"></div>\n        <div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:7px;font-size:10px;color:#AEB9C9\">\n          <svg class=\"i\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#6A85B4\" stroke-width=\"1.9\"><path d=\"M20 10c0 5-8 11-8 11S4 15 4 10a8 8 0 1 1 16 0Z\"/><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"10\" r=\"2.4\"/></svg>\n          <span>Postnord, Sundbyberg</span>\n          <span style=\"margin-left:auto;color:#fff;font-weight:600\">Cargo van</span>\n          <span style=\"font-size:9px;font-weight:700;color:#7DD8A9;background:rgba(125,216,169,.12);border:1px solid rgba(125,216,169,.2);border-radius:99px;padding:4px 8px\">SCHEDULED</span>\n        </div>\n        <div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;margin-top:10px\">\n          <span style=\"font-size:9px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.1em;color:#9AA6B8\">CARGO</span>\n          <div style=\"flex:1;height:5px;border-radius:99px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.14);position:relative\">\n            <div style=\"position:absolute;left:0;top:0;bottom:0;width:79%;border-radius:99px;background:#F2761B\"></div>\n          </div>\n          <span style=\"font-size:9.5px;font-weight:700\">19 / 24</span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"eyebrow\" style=\"margin:22px 0 10px 4px\">EXPANDED · DEPARTING SOON</div>\n      <div class=\"island\" style=\"border-radius:30px;padding:15px 17px;border:1px solid rgba(242,118,27,.45)\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-3\" data-name=\"Expanded island — departing soon\">\n        <div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:11px\">\n          <div style=\"width:38px;height:38px;border-radius:50%;border:3px solid rgba(255,255,255,.14);border-top-color:#F2761B;border-right-color:#F2761B;transform:rotate(-20deg);display:grid;place-items:center\">\n            <span style=\"transform:rotate(20deg);font-size:11px;font-weight:800;color:#fff\">12</span>\n          </div>\n          <div style=\"flex:1\">\n            <div style=\"font-size:9px;color:#9AA6B8;font-weight:600\">Departs in</div>\n            <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;font-weight:700;margin-top:3px\">12 min · 14:00</div>\n          </div>\n          <div style=\"font-size:9px;font-weight:700;color:#FFB27A;background:rgba(242,118,27,.16);border:1px solid rgba(242,118,27,.28);border-radius:99px;padding:5px 9px\">DEPARTING SOON</div>\n        </div>\n        <div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:7px;font-size:10px;color:#AEB9C9;margin-top:11px\">\n          <svg class=\"i\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#6A85B4\" stroke-width=\"1.9\"><path d=\"M20 10c0 5-8 11-8 11S4 15 4 10a8 8 0 1 1 16 0Z\"/><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"10\" r=\"2.4\"/></svg>\n          <span>Stockholm → Tunis</span>\n          <span style=\"margin-left:auto;color:#fff;font-weight:600\">Gate B · Cargo van</span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <section style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:14px\" data-kid=\"1-2-2\" data-name=\"Lock Screen and notes\">\n\n      <div class=\"card\" style=\"padding:17px\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-1\" data-name=\"Lock Screen live activity\">\n        <div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;margin-bottom:13px\">\n          <div>\n            <p class=\"eyebrow\" style=\"margin:0\">LOCK SCREEN</p>\n            <h3 style=\"font-size:17px;margin:7px 0 0\">Live activity card</h3>\n          </div>\n          <span style=\"font-size:10px;font-weight:600;color:#55627A;background:#F4F6FA;border:1px solid #E4E9F0;border-radius:99px;padding:5px 9px\">white tint · navy text</span>\n        </div>\n        <div style=\"background:linear-gradient(150deg,#587089,#233851);border-radius:18px;padding:26px 20px 20px\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-1\">\n          <div style=\"text-align:center;color:#fff;margin-bottom:16px\">\n            <div style=\"font-size:40px;font-weight:500;letter-spacing:-1.6px;line-height:1\">9:41</div>\n            <div style=\"font-size:11px;margin-top:6px;opacity:.88\">Saturday, 15 November</div>\n          </div>\n          <div style=\"background:rgba(255,255,255,.96);border-radius:20px;padding:14px;box-shadow:0 10px 24px rgba(12,22,38,.2)\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-1-1\">\n            <div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:11px\">\n              <div style=\"width:40px;height:40px;border-radius:13px;background:#FFF4EC;color:#F2761B;display:grid;place-items:center\">\n                <svg class=\"i\" width=\"19\" height=\"19\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.9\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"><path d=\"M3 16h18l-2-6H6l-3 6Z\"/><path d=\"M6 16v2m12-2v2\"/><circle cx=\"7\" cy=\"17\" r=\"1.5\"/><circle cx=\"17\" cy=\"17\" r=\"1.5\"/></svg>\n              </div>\n              <div style=\"flex:1\">\n                <div style=\"font-size:9px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.1em;color:#8A97AC\">NEXT DEPARTURE</div>\n                <div style=\"font-size:13px;font-weight:700;margin-top:4px\">15 Nov · 14:00</div>\n                <div style=\"font-size:10.5px;color:#55627A;margin-top:3px\">Sweden → Tunisia</div>\n              </div>\n              <div style=\"width:34px;height:34px;border-radius:50%;border:3.5px solid #FFE7D4;border-top-color:#F2761B;border-right-color:#F2761B;transform:rotate(-30deg)\"></div>\n            </div>\n            <div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;margin-top:11px;background:#F4F6FA;border-radius:13px;padding:9px 10px;font-size:10px;color:#55627A\">\n              <svg class=\"i\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#132B55\" stroke-width=\"1.9\"><path d=\"M20 10c0 5-8 11-8 11S4 15 4 10a8 8 0 1 1 16 0Z\"/><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"10\" r=\"2.4\"/></svg>\n              <span>Stockholm → Tunis</span>\n              <span style=\"margin-left:auto;font-weight:600;color:#132B55\">Cargo van</span>\n            </div>\n            <div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;margin-top:10px\">\n              <span style=\"font-size:9px;font-weight:700;color:#17865B;background:#E7F5EE;border:1px solid #BFE5D1;border-radius:99px;padding:4px 8px\">SCHEDULED</span>\n              <div style=\"flex:1;height:4px;border-radius:99px;background:#E4E9F0;position:relative\">\n                <div style=\"position:absolute;left:0;top:0;bottom:0;width:79%;border-radius:99px;background:#F2761B\"></div>\n              </div>\n              <span style=\"font-size:9.5px;font-weight:700;color:#132B55\">19 / 24</span>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"spec\"><span class=\"dot\"></span><span>Same component as the expanded island — only the container tint changes.</span></div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"card\" style=\"padding:17px\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-2\" data-name=\"Island states\">\n        <p class=\"eyebrow\" style=\"margin:0\">STATE MATRIX</p>\n        <div style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:7px;margin-top:11px\">\n          <span class=\"chip\" style=\"color:#17865B;background:#E7F5EE;border:1px solid #BFE5D1\">Scheduled</span>\n          <span class=\"chip\" style=\"color:#D65E0A;background:#FFF4EC;border:1px solid #FFE7D4\">Departing soon</span>\n          <span class=\"chip\" style=\"color:#132B55;background:#EEF2F8;border:1px solid #DCE4EF\">Departed</span>\n          <span class=\"chip\" style=\"color:#B23036;background:#FBEDEE;border:1px solid #F3CDD0\">Cancelled</span>\n          <span class=\"chip\" style=\"color:#55627A;background:#F4F6FA;border:1px solid #E4E9F0\">Full</span>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"spec\"><span class=\"dot\"></span><span>Capacity row collapses on cancelled and full; the vehicle line stays.</span></div>\n        <div class=\"spec\"><span class=\"dot\"></span><span>Activity ends automatically two hours after departure.</span></div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"card\" style=\"padding:17px\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-3\" data-name=\"Island behaviour\">\n        <p class=\"eyebrow\" style=\"margin:0\">BEHAVIOUR</p>\n        <div class=\"spec\"><span class=\"dot\"></span><span>Orange keyline tint on the island edge; tap opens <b style=\"color:#132B55\">trips/&lt;id&gt;</b>.</span></div>\n        <div class=\"spec\"><span class=\"dot\"></span><span>Countdown uses a self-updating timer text — no push needed.</span></div>\n        <div class=\"spec\"><span class=\"dot\"></span><span>Arabic strings with forced LTR layout, matching the app.</span></div>\n        <div style=\"display:flex;gap:8px;margin-top:12px;font-family:ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,monospace;font-size:9.5px;color:#8A97AC;flex-wrap:wrap\">\n          <span style=\"background:#F4F6FA;border:1px solid #E4E9F0;border-radius:7px;padding:5px 7px\">compactLeading</span>\n          <span style=\"background:#F4F6FA;border:1px solid #E4E9F0;border-radius:7px;padding:5px 7px\">compactTrailing</span>\n          <span style=\"background:#F4F6FA;border:1px solid #E4E9F0;border-radius:7px;padding:5px 7px\">minimal</span>\n          <span style=\"background:#F4F6FA;border:1px solid #E4E9F0;border-radius:7px;padding:5px 7px\">expanded ×3</span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n  </div>\n\n  <div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;border-top:1px solid #E4E9F0;margin-top:26px;padding-top:14px;font-size:10px;color:#8A97AC\" data-kid=\"1-3\">\n    <span>Dynamic Island · one activity, four presentations, brand navy/orange with orange keyline</span>\n    <span style=\"font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.08em\">TUNISISKA MEGA TRANSPORT</span>\n  </div>\n</div>\n",
      "comments": [],
